/-!
# The ATLAS permutation model of the Rudvalis group

`TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru` is the subgroup of `Equiv.Perm (Fin 4060)` generated by the two permutations
`Ru.a` and `Ru.b` of the ATLAS representation `RuG1-p4060B0`, the images of the standard
generators of the Rudvalis group `Ru` in its permutation representation on `4060` points. That is
the index of the maximal subgroups of shape `²F₄(2)` of `Ru`, and the least degree in which `Ru`
acts faithfully; the action has rank `3`, with suborbits of lengths `1`, `1755` and `2304`.

The tables are the forward images of the files `RuG1-p4060B0.m1` and `RuG1-p4060B0.m2`: the file
point `i` is the point `i - 1` of `Fin 4060`, and entry `i` of a table is the image of the point
`i`. Products follow Mathlib's convention `(σ * τ) x = σ (τ x)`. The two generators have orders
`2` and `4`, and their product has order `13`.

Neither the order of the model nor its transitivity, primitivity or simplicity is asserted here.
The module `TauCeti.GroupTheory.SpecificGroups.Sporadic.Rudvalis.Presentation` gives three
permutations that generate the model and satisfy the relators of the presentation selected for
`Ru`, and so maps the presented group onto the model.

## Main declarations

* `TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru`: the permutation model of the Rudvalis group on `4060` points.
* `TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru.a_inv`, `TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru.b_inv`: the inverses of the generators, the
  first generator itself and the cube of the second.
* `TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru.orderOf_a`, `TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru.orderOf_b`,
  `TauCeti.Sporadic.Ru.orderOf_a_mul_b`: the generators have orders `2` and `4`, and their product
  has order `13`.

## References

* R. A. Wilson, R. A. Parker, J. N. Bray et al., *ATLAS of Finite Group Representations*,
  version 3, representation `RuG1-p4060B0`,
  <https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/v3/permrep/RuG1-p4060B0>. Forward image files, with the
  SHA-256 digests of the bytes the tables were read from:
  <https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/spor/Ru/mtx/RuG1-p4060B0.m1>
  (`1c60df2cdd1207bdaa1c563ba96cb9423645d15e6cac85e26762d078820f6c55`) and
  <https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/spor/Ru/mtx/RuG1-p4060B0.m2>
  (`e05e50192b822500c5a0d8c27e63404ef7cb5577521db3d50049e826a254ff83`).
-/

